{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20549","headline":"贺秘书王丞南郊摄将军 · 张籍","name":"贺秘书王丞南郊摄将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正初天子亲郊礼，诏摄将军领卫兵。\n斜带银刀入黄道，先随玉辂到青城。\n坛边不在千官位，仗外唯闻再拜声。\n共喜与君逢此日，病中无计得随行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}